   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d296e20">
         <p>The <b>Fields</b> section of the Document Panel lists all smart fields in the agreement document. Use the Document Panel to take the following actions on fields in the document:</p>
         <ul>
            <li>
               <xref href="#docfieldsviewchange">View and change field values in the document</xref>
            </li>
            <li>
               <xref href="#docfieldsmarkfields">Mark Fields</xref>
            </li>
            <li>
               <xref href="#docfieldsrejectchanges">Reject changed field values</xref>
            </li>
            <li>
               <xref href="#docfieldsvalidatefields">Validate field value format</xref>
            </li>
            <li>
               <xref href="#docfieldsdeletefields">Mark fields for deletion</xref>
            </li>
         </ul>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>